- I4R report template on Zenodo ("I4R Template: Reproduction Report -
  General"), not yet fetched: the authoritative report format.
- Prior harness analysis: `design/pillage-0266-agentic-reproduction-2026-07-12.md`.
- CIRED reproducible-science project (`~/CNRS/projets/actifs/science reproductible`,
